  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 302.02 Draft permit",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 302.02 “Draft permit” means a document prepared pursuant to Env-Hw 304.19 that reflects the department’s intent to issue, modify, revoke and reissue, or reissue a permit.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Hw 300) #9362, eff 1-28-09; ss by #12345, eff 8-14-17",
